SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Togo national football team attack (Angola)
DESCRIPTION:A terrorist attack occurred on 8 January 2010 as the Togo natio
 nal football team traveled through the Angolan province of Cabinda on the 
 way to the 2010 Africa Cup of Nations tournament\, two days before it bega
 n in Angola.\n\nCrisis: Angola\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Togo
