DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100111
SUMMARY:2010 French Guianan status referendum (France)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on becoming an autonomous overseas territory was h
 eld in French Guiana on 10 January 2010. The proposal was rejected by 70% 
 of voters who prefer full integration in the French central state. The tur
 nout was 48%. A simultaneous referendum was rejected in Martinique.\n\nRef
 erendum: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_French_Guianan
 _status_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.d
 ev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_French_Guianan_status_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cc77142976d53857@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100111
SUMMARY:2010 Martiniquean status referendum (France)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on becoming an overseas territory was held in Mart
 inique on 10 January 2010. The proposal was rejected by 79% of voters\, wi
 th a turnout of 55%. A simultaneous referendum was rejected in French Guia
 na.\n\nReferendum: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Mart
 iniquean_status_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi
 .pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Martiniquean_status_referendum
