UID:871106bab5f55958@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100120
SUMMARY:Assassination of Mahmoud Al-Mabhouh (United Arab Emirates)
DESCRIPTION:The assassination of Mahmoud al-Mabhouh took place on 19 Januar
 y 2010\, in a hotel room in Dubai. Al-Mabhouh—a co-founder of the Izz ad
 -Din al-Qassam Brigades\, the military wing of Hamas—was wanted by the I
 sraeli government for the kidnapping and murder of two Israeli soldiers in
  1989 as well as purchasing arms from Iran for use in Gaza\; these have be
 en…\n\nAssassination: United Arab Emirates\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/Assassination_of_Mahmoud_Al-Mabhouh\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
 .0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Assassination
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Mahmoud_Al-Mabhouh
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
