SUMMARY:Citizens United v. FEC (United States)
DESCRIPTION:Citizens United v. Federal Election Commission\, 558 U.S. 310 (
 2010)\, is a landmark decision of the Supreme Court of the United States r
 uling that certain campaign finance restrictions are inconsistent with the
  Free Speech Clause of the First Amendment.\n\nCourt ruling: United States
 \nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citizens_United_v._FEC\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
