DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100125
SUMMARY:2010 French Guianan government referendum (France)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on merging the regional and departmental governmen
 ts was held in French Guiana on 24 January 2010. The proposal was approved
  by 57% of voters.\n\nReferendum: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/2010_French_Guianan_government_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA
  4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
