SUMMARY:2010 Saint Kitts and Nevis general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Saint Kitts and Nevis on 25 Janu
 ary 2010 for eleven of the fourteen or fifteen seats in the National Assem
 bly. The other three or four members of the National Assembly will be appo
 inted by the Governor-General after the elections.\n\nElection: Saint Kitt
 s and Nevis\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Saint_Kitts_and_Ne
 vis_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages
