DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100128
SUMMARY:Porfirio Lobo Sosa takes power (Honduras)
DESCRIPTION:Porfirio Lobo Sosa also known by his nickname\, Pepe Lobo\, is 
 a Honduran former politician\, business administrator\, and agricultural l
 andowner who served as 37th President of Honduras from 27 January 2010 to 
 27 January 2014.\n\nNew leader: Honduras\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/Porfirio_Lobo_Sosa\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.p
