DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100204
SUMMARY:2010 Greek presidential election (Greece)
DESCRIPTION:An indirect presidential election was held in Greece on 3 Febru
 ary 2010. Incumbent President Karolos Papoulias was nominated by the rulin
 g PASOK party and secured the support of the main opposition party\, New D
 emocracy\, as well as that of the smaller LAOS. Papoulias stood unopposed 
 and was elected on the first ballot\, with 266 votes.\n\nElection: Greece\
 nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Greek_presidential_election\nT
 ext: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Greek_presidential_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
