DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100208
SUMMARY:2010 Ukrainian presidential election (Ukraine)
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Ukraine on 17 January 2010.
  As no candidate received a majority of the vote\, a run-off election was 
 held between Prime Minister Yulia Tymoshenko and opposition leader Viktor 
 Yanukovych on 7 February.\n\nElection: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2010_Ukrainian_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-S
 A 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
