SUMMARY:Ivo Josipović takes power (Croatia)
DESCRIPTION:Ivo Josipović is a Croatian academic\, jurist\, composer\, and
  politician who served as the president of Croatia from 2010 to 2015.\n\nN
 ew leader: Croatia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivo_Josipovi%C4%
