DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100219
SUMMARY:Coup: 2010 Nigerien coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:A coup d'état occurred in Niger on 18 February 2010. Soldiers 
 attacked the presidential palace in Niamey under weapons fire at midday an
 d captured President Mamadou Tandja\, who was chairing a government meetin
 g at the time.\n\nCoup: Niger\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_
 Nigerien_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
