DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100223
SUMMARY:Latin American and Caribbean Unity Summit (Mexico)
DESCRIPTION:The Latin American and Caribbean Unity Summit was an internatio
 nal summit held on 22 and 23 February 2010 in Playa del Carmen\, Mexico. T
 he summit was the joint celebration of the XXI Rio Summit and the II Latin
  American and Caribbean Summit on Integration and Development (CALC).\n\nS
 ummit: Mexico\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latin_American_and_Ca
 ribbean_Unity_Summit\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages
 .dev).
