DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100225
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100226
SUMMARY:Viktor Yanukovych takes power (Ukraine)
DESCRIPTION:Viktor Fedorovych Yanukovych is a Ukrainian former politician w
 ho served as the fourth president of Ukraine from 2010 to 2014. He also se
 rved as the prime minister of Ukraine several times between 2002 and 2007 
 and was a member of the Verkhovna Rada (parliament) from 2006 to 2010.\n\n
 New leader: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viktor_Yanukovy
 ch\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
