DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100227
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100228
SUMMARY:2010 Nauruan constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Nauru on 27 February 20
 10. Voters were asked to vote on amendments to the constitution\, most not
 ably a change to a directly elected president and a strengthening of human
  rights legislation. A two-thirds majority was required for the amendments
  to pass.\n\nReferendum: Nauru\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010
 _Nauruan_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
 RP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Nauruan_constitutional_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
