DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100306
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100307
SUMMARY:Haris Silajdžić takes power (Bosnia and Herzegovina)
DESCRIPTION:Haris Silajdžić is a Bosnian politician and academic who serv
 ed as the Bosniak member of the Presidency of Bosnia and Herzegovina from 
 2006 to 2010. He was the Prime Minister of the Republic of Bosnia and Herz
 egovina from 1993 to 1996\, and previously served as Minister of Foreign A
 ffairs from 1990 to 1993.\n\nNew leader: Bosnia and Herzegovina\nSource: h
 ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haris_Silajd%C5%BEi%C4%87\nText: Wikipedia (C
 C BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
