DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20100329
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20100330
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2010 Moscow Metro bombings (Russia)
DESCRIPTION:The 2010 Moscow Metro bombings were suicide bombings carried ou
 t by two female Islamic terrorists during the morning rush hour of March 2
 9\, 2010\, at two stations of the Moscow Metro\, with roughly 40 minutes i
 n between. At least 40 people were killed\, and over 100 injured.\n\nCrisi
 s: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_Moscow_Metro_bombing
 s\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
