DESCRIPTION:The Agreement between Ukraine and Russia on the Black Sea Fleet
  in Ukraine\, widely referred to as the Kharkiv Pact or Kharkov Accords\, 
 was a treaty between Ukraine and Russia whereby the Russian lease on naval
  facilities in Crimea was extended beyond 2017 until 2042\, with an additi
 onal five-year renewal option in exchange for a multiyear discounted contr
 act…\n\nTreaty: Ukraine\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kharkiv_P
