DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Hungary on 11 and 25 April
  2010 to elect the members of the National Assembly. They were the sixth f
 ree elections since the end of the communist era. 386 Members of Parliamen
 t (MPs) were elected in a combined system of party lists and electoral con
 stituencies.\n\nElection: Hungary\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2
