SUMMARY:Belgrade anti-gay riot (Serbia)
DESCRIPTION:The Belgrade anti-gay riot was an incident of violence against 
 LGBTQ people that occurred on 10 October 2010 during a pride parade\, orga
 nized to promote LGBTQ rights in Serbia. The gay pride parade has been the
  first in Belgrade since 2001\; a planned parade in 2009 was cancelled due
  to the threat of violence.\n\nProtest: Serbia\nSource: https://en.wikiped
