 njured in a bombing attack targeting Coptic Christians in Alexandria\, Egy
 pt\, on New Year's Day\, 1 January 2011. The attack occurred as the Christ
 ian worshipers were leaving a church.\n\nCrisis: Egypt\nSource: https://en
