SUMMARY:2011 Egyptian revolution
DESCRIPTION:The 2011 Egyptian revolution\, also known as the 25 January Rev
 olution\, began on 25 January 2011 and spread across Egypt. The date was s
 et by various youth groups to coincide with National Police Day as a state
 ment against increasing police brutality during the later years of Hosni M
 ubarak's presidency.\n\nProtest: Egypt\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
 iki/2011_Egyptian_revolution\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
