SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami (Japan)
DESCRIPTION:On 11 March 2011\, at 14:46:24 local time (UTC+9)\, a Mw 9.0–
 9.1 undersea megathrust earthquake occurred in the Pacific Ocean\, 72 km (
 45 mi) east of the Oshika Peninsula of the Tōhoku region of Japan. It las
 ted approximately six minutes and caused a tsunami. It is sometimes known 
 in Japan as the "Great East Japan Earthquake" \, among other names.\n\nCri
 sis: Japan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_T%C5%8Dhoku_earthqu
