SUMMARY:2011 French Senate election (France)
DESCRIPTION:A Senate election was held for 165 of the 348 seats in the Sena
 te of France on 25 September 2011. Senate members were primarily elected b
 y municipal officials\, and the number of senators was increased from 343 
 to 348\, due to the growth of France's population since the previous elect
 ion was held in 2008.\n\nElection: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.or
 g/wiki/2011_French_Senate_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
