SUMMARY:Helle Thorning-Schmidt takes power (Denmark)
DESCRIPTION:Helle Thorning-Schmidt is a Danish retired politician who serve
 d as the prime minister of Denmark from 2011 to 2015 and leader of the Soc
 ial Democrats from 2005 to 2015. She is the first woman to have held each 
 post. Following defeat in 2015\, she announced that she would step down as
  both prime minister and party leader.\n\nNew leader: Denmark\nSource: htt
 ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helle_Thorning-Schmidt\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
