DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20111010
SUMMARY:2011 Paraguayan expatriate voting referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on allowing expatriate citizens to vote was held i
 n Paraguay on 9 October 2011. The measure was approved by 78% of voters\, 
 although voter turnout was only 12.5%. If approved by the Congress\, the m
 easure would give the right to vote to more than half a million Paraguayan
 s living abroad\, mostly in Argentina\, Spain and the United States.\n\nRe
 ferendum: Paraguay\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_Paraguayan_
