SUMMARY:2011 Russian legislative election (Soviet Union / Russia)
DESCRIPTION:Legislative elections were held in Russia on 4 December 2011. A
 t stake were the 450 seats in the 6th State Duma\, the lower house of the 
 Federal Assembly. United Russia won the elections with 49.32% of the vote\
 , taking 238 seats or 52.88% of the Duma seats.\n\nElection: Soviet Union 
 / Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_Russian_legislative_e
 lection\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_Russian_legislative_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
