SUMMARY:Elio Di Rupo takes power (Belgium)
DESCRIPTION:Elio Di Rupo is a Belgian politician who served as the prime mi
 nister of Belgium from 2011 to 2014\, heading the Di Rupo Government\, and
  as minister-president of Wallonia for three non-consecutive terms between
  1999 and 2024.\n\nNew leader: Belgium\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
 iki/Elio_Di_Rupo\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev
