SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Treaty of Accession 2011 (Belgium)
DESCRIPTION:The Treaty of Accession 2011 is an agreement between the member
  states of the European Union and Croatia concerning Croatia's accession t
 o the EU. It was signed on 9 December 2011 in Brussels by the heads of sta
 te or government of the 27 member states and by the president of Croatia\,
  Ivo Josipović\, and Prime Minister Jadranka Kosor.\n\nTreaty: Belgium\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Accession_2011\nText: Wikip
 edia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
