SUMMARY:Ruling: 2008–2011 Cambodian–Thai border crisis (Thailand)
DESCRIPTION:The 2008–2011 Cambodian–Thai border crisis began in June 20
 08 until December 2011 as part of long-standing territorial dispute betwee
 n Cambodia and Thailand involving the area surrounding Preah Vihear\, an 1
 1th-century Hindu temple in the Dângrêk Mountains\, between Choam Khsant
  District\, Preah Vihear province of northern Cambodia and the Kantharalak
 …\n\nCourt ruling: Thailand\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008%
 E2%80%932011_Cambodian%E2%80%93Thai_border_crisis\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
