SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Christmas 2011 Nigeria attacks
DESCRIPTION:A series of attacks occurred during Christmas Day church servic
 es in northern Nigeria on 25 December 2011. There were bomb blasts and sho
 otings at churches in Madalla\, Jos\, Gadaka\, and Damaturu. A total of 41
  people were reported dead.\n\nCrisis: Nigeria\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/Christmas_2011_Nigeria_attacks\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)
