SUMMARY:2011 Jamaican general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Jamaica on 29 December 2011. The
  elections were contested mainly between the nation's two major political 
 parties\, the governing Jamaica Labour Party (JLP)\, led by Andrew Holness
 \, and the Portia Simpson-Miller-led opposition People's National Party (P
 NP).\n\nElection: Jamaica\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_Jama
 ican_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
