DESCRIPTION:Eveline Widmer-Schlumpf is a Swiss politician and lawyer who se
 rved as a Member of the Swiss Federal Council from 2008 to 2015. A member 
 of the Swiss People's Party (SVP/UDC) until 2008\, she was then a member o
 f the splinter Conservative Democratic Party (BDP/PBD) until 2021\, when t
 hat party merged into The Centre.\n\nNew leader: Switzerland\nSource: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eveline_Widmer-Schlumpf\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
