DESCRIPTION:From January 3 to June 5\, 2012\, voters of the Democratic Part
 y chose its nominee for president in the 2012 United States presidential e
 lection. President Barack Obama won the Democratic Party nomination by sec
 uring more than the required 2\,383 delegates on April 3\, 2012\, after a 
 series of primary elections and caucuses.\n\nParty contest: United States\
