SUMMARY:2012 Romanian protests
DESCRIPTION:The 2012 Romanian protests were a series of protests and civil 
 manifestations triggered by the introduction of new health reform legislat
 ion. In particular\, President Traian Băsescu criticized the Deputy Minis
 ter of Health\, Raed Arafat\, on a Romanian television broadcast.\n\nProte
 st: Romania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2012_Romanian_protests\
 nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
