DESCRIPTION:Otto Fernando Pérez Molina is a Guatemalan politician and reti
 red general who served as the 48th president of Guatemala from 2012 to 201
 5. Standing as the Patriotic Party candidate\, he lost the 2007 presidenti
 al election but prevailed in the 2011 presidential election.\n\nNew leader
 : Guatemala\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otto_P%C3%A9rez_Molina\
