SUMMARY:Coup: Tuareg rebellion (2012) (Mali)
DESCRIPTION:The 2012 Tuareg rebellion was the early phase of the Mali War\;
  from January to April 2012\, a war was waged against the Malian governmen
 t by rebels with the goal of attaining independence for the northern regio
 n of Mali\, known as Azawad.\n\nCoup: Mali\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/Tuareg_rebellion_(2012)\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP 
