DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20120119
SUMMARY:Protests against SOPA and PIPA
DESCRIPTION:On January 18\, 2012\, a series of coordinated protests occurre
 d against two proposed laws in the United States Congress—the Stop Onlin
 e Piracy Act (SOPA) and the PROTECT IP Act (PIPA). These followed smaller 
 protests in late 2011.\n\nProtest: International\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Protests_against_SOPA_and_PIPA\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
 0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
