DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20120123
SUMMARY:2012 Croatian European Union membership referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the EU accession of the Republic of Croatia was
  held on 22 January 2012. Croatia finished accession (membership) negotiat
 ions on 30 June 2011 and signed the Treaty of Accession on 9 December 2011
 \, setting it on course to become the bloc's 28th member state.\n\nReferen
 dum: Croatia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2012_Croatian_European
 _Union_membership_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
 pi.pages.dev).
