DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20120202
SUMMARY:Port Said Stadium riot (Egypt)
DESCRIPTION:The Port Said Stadium riot was a riot which occurred at Port Sa
 id Stadium in Port Said\, Egypt on 1 February\, 2012\, following an Egypti
 an Premier League football match between Al Masry and Al Ahly. Seventy-fou
 r people were killed and more than 500 injured after thousands of Al Masry
  fans invaded the pitch following a 3–1 victory of their club.\n\nProtes
 t: Egypt\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_Said_Stadium_riot\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Protest
