SUMMARY:2012 PSOE federal party congress (Spain)
DESCRIPTION:The Spanish Socialist Workers' Party (PSOE) held its 38th feder
 al congress in Seville from 3 to 5 February 2012\, to renovate its governi
 ng bodies—including the post of secretary-general\, which amounted to th
 at of party leader—and establish the party platform and policy until the
  next congress.\n\nParty contest: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/
 wiki/2012_PSOE_federal_party_congress\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, vi
 a PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
