SUMMARY:2012 Faroese municipal merger referendum (Denmark)
DESCRIPTION:A municipal merger referendum was held in the Faroe Islands on 
 3 May 2012. Proposals were put forward for merging the thirty existing mun
 icipalities into seven new municipalities\, with voters in each of the pro
 posed new areas voting on the merger. The proposition was rejected in six 
 of the seven proposed new municipalities.\n\nReferendum: Denmark\nSource: 
