DESCRIPTION:A non-binding referendum on ending conscription was held in Aus
 tria on 20 January 2013. The proposal was supported by the Social Democrat
 ic Party and the Green Party and opposed by the Austrian People's Party an
 d the FPÖ. Though constitutionally not obligated to act on\, both parties
  in government stated that they would honour the results.\n\nReferendum: A
 ustria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Austrian_conscription_r
