DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20130416
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Boston Marathon bombing (United States)
DESCRIPTION:The Boston Marathon bombing\, sometimes referred to as simply t
 he Boston bombing\, was an Islamist domestic terrorist attack that took pl
 ace during the 117th annual Boston Marathon on April 15\, 2013. Four hours
  into the race\, Tamerlan Tsarnaev and Dzhokhar Tsarnaev detonated two hom
 emade pressure cooker bombs containing explosives and steel shrapnel.\n\nC
 risis: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boston_Maratho
 n_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boston_Marathon_bombing
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
