DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20130417
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2013 Saravan earthquake (Iran)
DESCRIPTION:The 2013 Saravan earthquake occurred with a moment magnitude of
  7.7 at 15:14 pm IRDT (UTC+4:30) on 16 April. The shock struck a mountaino
 us area between the cities of Saravan and Khash in Sistan and Balochistan 
 province\, Iran\, close to the border with Pakistan\, with a duration of a
 bout 25 seconds.\n\nCrisis: Iran\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/20
 13_Saravan_earthquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
