DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20130421
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2013 Lushan earthquake (China)
DESCRIPTION:The Lushan earthquake or Ya'an earthquake occurred at 08:02 Bei
 jing Time on April 20\, 2013. The epicenter was located in Lushan County\,
  Ya'an\, Sichuan\, about 116 km (72 mi) from Chengdu along the Longmenshan
  Fault in the same province heavily impacted by the 2008 Sichuan earthquak
 e.\n\nCrisis: China\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Lushan_ear
 thquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
