SUMMARY:Enrico Letta takes power (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:Enrico Letta is an Italian politician who served as Prime Minis
 ter of Italy from April 2013 to February 2014\, leading a grand coalition 
 of centre-left and centre-right parties. He later was the leader of the De
 mocratic Party (PD) from March 2021 to March 2023.\n\nNew leader: Italy\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enrico_Letta\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
 SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
