 rma) and DKBA 5 over control of Karen\, starting 2013-04-29. This episode 
 was active in 1 year (2013–2013)\, below war level (25–999 battle deat
 hs a year)\, and ended 2013-04-29.\n\nConflict: Myanmar\nSource: https://u
