DESCRIPTION:On 19 May 2013\, violent disturbances broke out in Husby\, a su
 burb dominated by immigrants and second-generation immigrant residents\, i
 ncluding a substantial number from Somalia\, Eritrea\, Afghanistan and Ira
 q\, in northern Stockholm\, Sweden.\n\nProtest: Sweden\nSource: https://en
 .wikipedia.org/wiki/May_2013_Stockholm_riots\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
