SUMMARY:Sigmundur Davíð Gunnlaugsson takes power (Iceland)
DESCRIPTION:Sigmundur Davíð Gunnlaugsson is an Icelandic politician who w
 as the prime minister of Iceland from May 2013 until April 2016. He was al
 so chairman of the Progressive Party from 2009 to October 2016. He was ele
 cted to the Althing as the 8th member for the Reykjavík North Constituenc
 y on 25 April 2009.\n\nNew leader: Iceland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/Sigmundur_Dav%C3%AD%C3%B0_Gunnlaugsson\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
