SUMMARY:Gezi Park protests (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:A wave of demonstrations and civil unrest in Turkey began on 28
  May 2013\, initially to contest the urban development plan for Istanbul's
  Gezi Park. The protests were sparked by outrage at the violent eviction o
 f a sit-in at the park protesting the plan.\n\nProtest: Turkey\nSource: ht
 tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gezi_Park_protests\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
