SUMMARY:Plamen Oresharski takes power (Bulgaria)
DESCRIPTION:Plamen Vasilev Oresharski is a Bulgarian politician who served 
 as Prime Minister of Bulgaria from 2013 to 2014. Affiliated with the Bulga
 rian Socialist Party\, he previously served as Member of the National Asse
 mbly from 2009 to 2013\, Minister of Finance from 2005 to 2009 and Deputy 
 Minister of Finance from 1997 to 2001.\n\nNew leader: Bulgaria\nSource: ht
