SUMMARY:2013 Albanian parliamentary election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Albania on 23 June 2013. T
 he result was a victory for the Alliance for a European Albania led by the
  Socialist Party and its leader\, Edi Rama. Incumbent Prime Minister Sali 
 Berisha of the Democratic Party-led Alliance for Employment\, Prosperity a
 nd Integration conceded defeat on 26 June.\n\nElection: Albania\nSource: h
