DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20130704
SUMMARY:Coup: 2013 Egyptian coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:On July 3\, 2013\, then-President of Egypt Mohamed Morsi was ov
 erthrown by a coup d'etat led by Egyptian army chief General Abdel Fattah 
 el-Sisi\, who led a coalition to remove Morsi from power and suspend the E
 gyptian constitution of 2012.\n\nCoup: Egypt\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
