SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2013 Bodh Gaya bombings (India)
DESCRIPTION:On 7 July 2013 a series of ten bombs exploded in and around the
  Mahabodhi Temple complex\, a UNESCO World Heritage Site in Bodh Gaya\, In
 dia. Five people\, including two Buddhist monks\, were injured by the blas
 ts. Three other devices were defused by bomb-disposal squads at a number o
 f locations in Gaya.\n\nCrisis: India\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/2013_Bodh_Gaya_bombings\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi
