  the prime minister of the Czech Republic between June 2013 and January 20
 14. From 2016 to 2022 he served as the governor of the Czech National Bank
 .\n\nNew leader: Czechia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ji%C5%99%C
 3%AD_Rusnok\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
