DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20130916
SUMMARY:Edi Rama takes power (Albania)
DESCRIPTION:Edvin Kristaq "Edi" Rama is an Albanian politician\, artist\, w
 riter\, and former professional basketball player who has served as prime 
 minister of Albania since 2013 and as chairman of the Socialist Party of A
 lbania since 2005. He was the Minister of Culture\, Youth and Sports from 
