SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2014 Kunming attack (China)
DESCRIPTION:On 1 March 2014\, a group of five knife-wielding terrorists att
 acked passengers in the Kunming Railway Station in Kunming\, Yunnan\, Chin
 a\, killing 31 people\, and wounding 143 others. The attackers pulled out 
 long-bladed knives and stabbed and slashed passengers at random.\n\nCrisis
 : China\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2014_Kunming_attack\nText: 
 Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
