DESCRIPTION:A general election was held in the United Kingdom on 7 May 2015
  to elect 650 members of Parliament (MPs) to the House of Commons. The Con
 servative Party\, led by Prime Minister David Cameron\, won an unexpected 
 majority victory of 10 seats\; they had been leading a coalition governmen
 t with the Liberal Democrats.\n\nElection: United Kingdom\nSource: https:/
