SUMMARY:Coup: 2015 Burundian coup attempt
DESCRIPTION:On 13 May 2015\, army general Godefroid Niyombare said that he 
 was "dismissing President Pierre Nkurunziza" following the 2015 Burundian 
 unrest. However\, the presidency tweeted that the "situation is under cont
 rol" and there is "no coup".\n\nCoup: Burundi\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/2015_Burundian_coup_attempt\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, v
