DESCRIPTION:The Palmyra offensive of May 2015 was a military operation laun
 ched during the Syrian Civil War by the Islamic State (IS) on May 13–26\
 , 2015\, in an attempt to capture the government-held Tadmur District of t
 he Homs Governorate\, including the administrative centre of Tadmur\, know
 n in English as Palmyra.\n\nConflict: Syria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
