 e of candidacy for the office of President of Ireland from 35 to 21. The b
 ill was introduced to the Oireachtas in January 2015 by the Fine Gael–La
 bour government\, after which both houses of the Oireachtas passed the bil
 l.\n\nElection: Ireland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thirty-fift
