DESCRIPTION:The 2015 Kuwait mosque bombing was a suicide bombing took place
  on 26 June 2015 at a Shia mosque in Kuwait City\, Kuwait. The Islamic Sta
 te of Iraq and the Levant claimed responsibility for the attack. Sabah al-
 Sabah\, the Emir at the time\, arrived at the location of the incident aft
 er a short period of time.\n\nCrisis: Kuwait\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/2015_Kuwait_mosque_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
