SUMMARY:Assassination of Shuja Khanzada (Pakistan)
DESCRIPTION:On 16 August 2015\, two suspected suicide bombers detonated exp
 losives at the political office of Punjab Interior Minister Shuja Khanzada
  in the Attock District village of Shadi Khan\, 80 km (50 mi) from the Pak
 istani capital Islamabad. The blasts killed the minister and 18 other peop
 le\; at least 17 people were injured and hospitalised.\n\nAssassination: P
 akistan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Shuja_Khan
 zada\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
