DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150818
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2015 Bangkok bombing (Thailand)
DESCRIPTION:On 17 August 2015\, a bombing took place inside the Erawan Shri
 ne at the Ratchaprasong intersection in Pathum Wan district\, Bangkok\, Th
 ailand\, killing 20 people and injuring 125.\n\nCrisis: Thailand\nSource: 
 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Bangkok_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
