DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20150821
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150822
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2015 Thalys train attack (France)
DESCRIPTION:On 21 August 2015\, a shooting and knife attack took place on a
  Thalys train on its way from Amsterdam to Paris. The perpetrator\, 25-yea
 r-old Moroccan national Ayoub El Khazzani\, was confronted by French\, Ame
 rican\, and British passengers who had noticed him carrying weapons onboar
 d.\n\nCrisis: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Thalys_tr
 ain_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
