DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150823
SUMMARY:2015–2016 Lebanese protests (Lebanon)
DESCRIPTION:The 2015–2016 Lebanese protests\, commonly referred to as the
  "You Stink" movement\, were a series of mass demonstrations in reaction t
 o a waste management crisis in Lebanon. The closure of the Naameh landfill
 \, which operated beyond its intended capacity since 1997\, led to the sus
 pension of garbage collection across Beirut and Mount Lebanon.\n\nProtest:
  Lebanon\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015%E2%80%932016_Lebanese
 _protests\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
