DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150907
SUMMARY:2015 Polish referendum (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:A three-part referendum was held in Poland on 6 September 2015.
  Voters were asked whether they approved of introducing single-member cons
 tituencies for Sejm elections\, maintaining state financing of political p
 arties and introducing a presumption in favour of the taxpayer in disputes
  over the tax law.\n\nReferendum: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/2015_Polish_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
