DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150917
SUMMARY:Coup: 2015 Burkina Faso coup attempt
DESCRIPTION:The 2015 Burkina Faso coup attempt was a failed coup d'état la
 unched on 16 September 2015 in Burkina Faso\, when members of the Regiment
  of Presidential Security (RSP) – a controversial autonomous military un
 it\, formed under President Blaise Compaoré – detained the country's go
 vernment.\n\nCoup: Burkina Faso\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/201
 5_Burkina_Faso_coup_attempt\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
