DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20150916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20150917
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2015 Illapel earthquake (Chile)
DESCRIPTION:The 2015 Illapel earthquake occurred 46 km (29 mi) offshore fro
 m Illapel on 16 September 2015 at 19:54:32 Chile Standard Time (22:54:32 U
 TC)\, with a moment magnitude of 8.3–8.4. The initial quake lasted betwe
 en three and five minutes\; it was followed by several aftershocks greater
  than magnitude six and two that exceeded magnitude seven.\n\nCrisis: Chil
