DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Belarus on 11 October 2015.
  Long-term president Alexander Lukashenko ran for his fifth term in office
 \, having won every presidential election since independence in 1991. He w
 as re-elected with 84% of the vote\, according to official figures. The 'a
 gainst all' option received more votes than any opposition candidate.\n\nE
