SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2015 Beirut bombings (Lebanon)
DESCRIPTION:On 12 November 2015\, two suicide bombers attacked Bourj el-Bar
 ajneh\, a southern suburb of Beirut\, Lebanon\, that is inhabited mostly b
 y Shia Muslims. Reports of the number of fatalities concluded that 43 peop
 le died directly from the detonation. Islamic State of Iraq and the Levant
  (ISIL) claimed responsibility for the attacks.\n\nCrisis: Lebanon\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Beirut_bombings\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Beirut_bombings
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
