SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: November 2015 Paris attacks (France)
DESCRIPTION:A series of coordinated Islamic terrorist attacks took place on
  Friday\, 13 November 2015 in Paris\, France\, and the city's northern sub
 urb\, Saint-Denis. Beginning at 21:16\, three suicide bombers struck outsi
 de the Stade de France in Saint-Denis\, during an international football m
 atch\, after failing to gain entry to the stadium.\n\nCrisis: France\nSour
 ce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_2015_Paris_attacks\nText: Wikip
 edia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_2015_Paris_attacks
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
