SUMMARY:2015 G20 Antalya summit (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:The 2015 G20 Antalya summit was the tenth meeting of the G20 he
 ads of government/heads of state. It was held in Belek\, Antalya Province\
 , Turkey. The venue for the Leaders Summit was Regnum Carya Hotel Conventi
 on Centre at the Regnum Carya Golf & Resort Spa.\n\nSummit: Turkey\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_G20_Antalya_summit\nText: Wikipedia (
