SUMMARY:APEC Philippines 2015
DESCRIPTION:APEC Philippines 2015 was the year-long hosting of the Asia-Pac
 ific Economic Cooperation (APEC) meetings which concluded with the APEC Ec
 onomic Leaders' Meeting held on 18–19 November 2015 in Pasay\, Metro Man
 ila. It was the second time the Philippines hosted the summit\, the first 
 being in 1996.\n\nSummit: Philippines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
