SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Radisson Blu Bamako attack (Mali)
DESCRIPTION:On 20 November 2015\, Islamist militants took 170 hostages and 
 killed 20 of them in a mass shooting at the Radisson Blu hotel in Bamako\,
  the capital city of Mali. The siege was ended when Malian special forces\
 , backed by U.S. and French personnel\, launched an assault on the hotel t
 o recover the surviving hostages.\n\nCrisis: Mali\nSource: https://en.wiki
 pedia.org/wiki/Radisson_Blu_Bamako_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\
 , via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radisson_Blu_Bamako_attack
