SUMMARY:Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting 2015 (Malta)
DESCRIPTION:The 2015 Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting\, also known 
 as CHOGM 2015\, was the 24th Meeting of the Heads of Government of the Com
 monwealth of Nations. It was held in Malta from 27 to 29 November. Sri Lan
 kan President Maithripala Sirisena handed the position of Commonwealth Cha
 ir-in-Office to Maltese Prime Minister Joseph Muscat at the meeting.\n\nSu
 mmit: Malta\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commonwealth_Heads_of_G
 overnment_Meeting_2015\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pag
