SUMMARY:2015 Danish European Union opt-out referendum (Denmark)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on one of the country's opt-outs from the European
  Union was held in Denmark on 3 December 2015. Specifically\, the referend
 um was on whether to convert Denmark's current full opt-out on home and ju
 stice matters into an opt-out with case-by-case opt-in similar to those he
 ld by Ireland and the United Kingdom.\n\nReferendum: Denmark\nSource: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Danish_European_Union_opt-out_referendum\nT
 ext: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
