SUMMARY:2015 Vincentian general election (Saint Vincent and the Grenadines)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Saint Vincent and the Grenadines
  on 9 December 2015. The result was a victory for the Unity Labour Party\,
  which retained its one seat majority. However\, the NDP has challenged th
 e results in two constituencies\, North Windward\, and Central Leeward.\n\
 nElection: Saint Vincent and the Grenadines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/2015_Vincentian_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\
