SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Paris Agreement (France)
DESCRIPTION:The Paris Agreement is an international treaty on climate chang
 e that was signed in 2016. The treaty covers climate change mitigation\, a
 daptation\, and finance. The Paris Agreement was negotiated by 196 parties
  at the 2015 United Nations Climate Change Conference near Paris\, France.
 \n\nTreaty: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paris_Agreement\
