SUMMARY:2015 Central African constitutional referendum (Central African Rep
 ublic)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in the Central African Rep
 ublic on 13 and 14 December 2015. The referendum was originally scheduled 
 to be held on 5 October 2015\, prior to general elections\, but was later 
 delayed. Violence on polling day led to voting being extended for another 
 day. The new constitution was approved by 93% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Ce
 ntral African Republic\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Central
 _African_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
 RP (jdpi.pages.dev).
