DESCRIPTION:A general election was held in Spain on 20 December 2015 to ele
 ct the members of the 11th Cortes Generales under the Spanish Constitution
  of 1978. All 350 seats in the Congress of Deputies were up for election\,
  as well as 208 of 266 seats in the Senate.\n\nElection: Spain\nSource: ht
