DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20151228
SUMMARY:2015 Haitian presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Haiti on 25 October 2015\, 
 alongside local elections and the second round of the legislative election
 s. Incumbent President Michel Martelly was constitutionally barred from ru
 nning. As no candidate received a majority of the vote in the first round\
 , a runoff was to be held on 27 December 2015.\n\nElection: Haiti\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2015_Haitian_presidential_election\nText: W
 ikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
