SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2016 Pathankot attack (India)
DESCRIPTION:On 2 January 2016\, four militants belonging to the United Jiha
 d Council attacked the Indian Air Force's Pathankot Airbase\, part of its 
 Western Air Command.\n\nCrisis: India\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/2016_Pathankot_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.p
 ages.dev).
