DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20160112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20160113
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: January 2016 Istanbul bombing (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:On 12 January 2016\, a suicide attack in Istanbul's historic Su
 ltanahmet district killed 13 people\, all foreigners\, and injured 14 othe
 rs. The attack occurred at 10:20 local time\, near the Blue Mosque and the
  Hagia Sophia\, an area popular among tourists. The attacker was Nabil Fad
 li\, a Syrian member of the Islamic State.\n\nCrisis: Turkey\nSource: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_2016_Istanbul_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (
 CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_2016_Istanbul_bombing
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
