SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2016 Jakarta attacks (Indonesia)
DESCRIPTION:On 14 January 2016\, multiple explosions and gunfire were repor
 ted near the Sarinah shopping mall in central Jakarta\, Indonesia\, at the
  intersection of Jalan Kyai Haji Wahid Hasyim and Jalan MH Thamrin. One bl
 ast went off in a Burger King restaurant outside the mall.\n\nCrisis: Indo
 nesia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Jakarta_attacks\nText: W
 ikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
