SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2016 Ouagadougou attacks (Burkina Faso)
DESCRIPTION:On 15 January 2016\, gunmen armed with heavy weapons attacked t
 he Cappuccino restaurant and the Splendid Hotel in the heart of Ouagadougo
 u\, the capital of Burkina Faso. At least 30 people were killed\, and 56 w
 ounded\; a total of 176 hostages were released after a government counter-
 attack into the next morning as the siege ended.\n\nCrisis: Burkina Faso\n
 Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Ouagadougou_attacks\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Ouagadougou_attacks
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
