DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Azerbaijan on 26 Septem
 ber 2016. Voters were asked whether they approved of 29 constitutional ame
 ndments\, with a separate vote on each one. All 29 amendments were approve
 d by between 89% and 95% of voters. The changes created the office of the 
 Vice President and extended the presidential term from five to seven years
 .\n\nReferendum: Azerbaijan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Az
 erbaijani_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via 
