DESCRIPTION:The 2016 Burkina Faso coup d'état attempt was an attempt to ov
 erthrow the government of Burkina Faso on 8 October 2016. At least 30 ex-m
 embers of the elite presidential guard planned an attack on three location
 s: the presidential residence\, an Army barracks\, and a prison in Ouagado
 ugou\, the capital of Burkina Faso.\n\nCoup: Burkina Faso\nSource: https:/
 /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Burkina_Faso_coup_attempt\nText: Wikipedia (CC
