SUMMARY:2016 Ivorian constitutional referendum (Ivory Coast)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Ivory Coast on 30 Octob
 er 2016. Voters were asked whether they approve of a proposed new constitu
 tion. The new constitution would create a Senate\, remove the nationality 
 clause from the presidential requirements and establish the post of Vice-P
