SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2016 Berlin truck attack (Germany)
DESCRIPTION:On 19 December 2016\, a truck was deliberately driven into the 
 Christmas market next to the Kaiser Wilhelm Memorial Church at Breitscheid
 platz in Berlin\, leaving 12 people dead and 56 others injured. One of the
  victims was the truck's original driver\, Łukasz Urban\, who was shot de
 ad hours before the attack.\n\nCrisis: Germany\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2016_Berlin_truck_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
  PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
