DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20161219
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20161220
SUMMARY:Assassination of Andrei Karlov (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:Andrei Karlov\, the Russian Ambassador to Turkey\, was assassin
 ated by Mevlüt Mert Altıntaş\, an off-duty Turkish police officer\, at 
 an art exhibition in Ankara\, Turkey\, on the evening of 19 December 2016.
  The assassination took place after several days of protests in Turkey ove
 r Russian involvement in the Syrian Civil War and the battle over Aleppo.\
