 nited States marked the commencement of the first term of Trump as preside
 nt and the only term of Mike Pence as vice president. An estimated 300\,00
 0 to 600\,000 people attended the public ceremony held on Friday\, January
  20\, 2017\, at the West Front of the United States Capitol in Washington\
 , D.C.\n\nInauguration: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
