SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2017 Westminster attack (United Kingdom)
DESCRIPTION:On 22 March 2017\, a terrorist attack took place outside the Pa
 lace of Westminster in London\, seat of the British Parliament. Khalid Mas
 ood\, a 52-year-old Briton\, drove a car into pedestrians on the pavement 
 along the south side of Westminster Bridge and Bridge Street\, injuring mo
 re than 50 people\, four of them fatally.\n\nCrisis: United Kingdom\nSourc
 e: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_Westminster_attack\nText: Wikipedia 
 (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
