  They had originally been scheduled for 2018 at the end of the four-year t
 erm of the National Assembly. However\, following the resignation of Prime
  Minister Boyko Borisov and the failure of Bulgarian parties to form a gov
 ernment\, early elections were called.\n\nElection: Bulgaria\nSource: http
