SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2017 Saint Petersburg Metro bombing (Russia)
DESCRIPTION:On 3 April 2017\, a terrorist attack using an explosive device 
 took place on the Saint Petersburg Metro between Sennaya Ploshchad and Tek
 hnologichesky Institut stations. Eleven people were initially reported to 
 have died\, and five more died later from their injuries\, bringing the to
 tal to 15.\n\nCrisis: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_S
 aint_Petersburg_Metro_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (j
