SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2017 Stockholm truck attack (Sweden)
DESCRIPTION:On 7 April 2017\, a vehicle-ramming terrorist attack took place
  in central Stockholm\, the capital of Sweden. A hijacked truck was delibe
 rately driven into crowds along Drottninggatan before being crashed into a
 n Åhléns department store. Five people were killed and 14 others were se
 riously injured.\n\nCrisis: Sweden\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
 2017_Stockholm_truck_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
