DESCRIPTION:On Palm Sunday\, 9 April 2017\, twin suicide bombings took plac
 e at St. George's Church in the northern Egyptian city of Tanta on the Nil
 e Delta\, and Saint Mark's Coptic Orthodox Cathedral\, the principal churc
 h in Alexandria\, seat of the Coptic papacy. At least 43 people were repor
 ted killed and 789 injured.\n\nCrisis: Egypt\nSource: https://en.wikipedia
 .org/wiki/Palm_Sunday_church_bombings\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, vi
