DESCRIPTION:On 11 April 2017\, the tour bus of the German football team Bor
 ussia Dortmund was attacked with roadside bombs in Dortmund\, Germany. Thr
 ee bombs exploded as the bus ferried the team to the Westfalenstadion for 
 the first leg of their quarter-final against Monaco in the UEFA Champions 
 League.\n\nCrisis: Germany\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borussia
