SUMMARY:Battle: Siege of Marawi (Philippines)
DESCRIPTION:The siege of Marawi\, also known as the Marawi crisis and the B
 attle of Marawi\, was a five-month-long armed conflict in Marawi\, Philipp
 ines\, that started on May 23\, 2017\, between Philippine government secur
 ity forces against militants affiliated with the Islamic State (IS)\, incl
 uding the Maute and Abu Sayyaf Salafi jihadist groups.\n\nConflict: Philip
 pines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Marawi\nText: Wikipe
