DESCRIPTION:The 43rd G7 summit was held on 26–27 May 2017 in Taormina (ME
 )\, Sicily\, Italy. In March 2014\, the G7 declared that a meaningful disc
 ussion was currently not possible with Russia in the context of the G8. Si
 nce then\, meetings have continued within the G7 process.\n\nSummit: Italy
