DESCRIPTION:The Conservative Party of Canada held a leadership election on 
 May 27\, 2017. The leadership election was prompted by the resignation of 
 Stephen Harper\, who had led the Conservative Party of Canada as its leade
 r from 2004\, after the party's defeat in the 2015 election.\n\nParty cont
 est: Canada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_Conservative_Party
