  Puerto Rico on June 11\, 2017. The referendum had three options: becoming
  a state of the United States\, independence/free association\, or maintai
 ning the current territorial status. Those who voted overwhelmingly chose 
 statehood with 97%.\n\nReferendum: United States\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/2017_Puerto_Rican_status_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
