 al congress in Madrid between 16 and 18 June 2017\, to renovate its govern
 ing bodies—including the post of secretary-general\, which amounted to t
 hat of party leader—and establish the party platform and policy until th
 e next congress\, after the sacking of Pedro Sánchez as party leader in O
 ctober…\n\nParty contest: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2
