SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2017 Finsbury Park van attack (United Kingdom)
DESCRIPTION:On 19 June 2017\, an Islamophobic terrorist attack occurred in 
 Finsbury Park\, London\, England\, when a van was intentionally driven int
 o a crowd of Muslim pedestrians near the Muslim Welfare House\, 100 yards 
 (90 m) from the Finsbury Park Mosque\, resulting in the death of a man and
  11 injuries. The attack was found to be motivated by Islamophobia.\n\nCri
 sis: United Kingdom\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_Finsbury_P
 ark_van_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
