SUMMARY:Nikol Pashinyan takes power (Armenia)
DESCRIPTION:Nikol Vovayi Pashinyan is an Armenian politician who has served
  as the 16th and current prime minister of Armenia since 2018. A journalis
 t by profession\, Pashinyan founded his own newspaper in 1998\, which was 
 shut down a year later for libel. He was sentenced for one year for defama
 tion against then Minister of National Security Serzh Sargsyan.\n\nNew lea
 der: Armenia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikol_Pashinyan\nText:
  Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikol_Pashinyan
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
