SUMMARY:2018 Slovenian railway referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on a law governing the Divača-Koper rail upgrade 
 was held in Slovenia on 13 May 2018. It followed the annulment of the resu
 lts of a 2017 referendum on the same subject by the Supreme Court in March
  2018. The result saw just 309 more votes cast against the law (50.06%) th
 an in favour (49.94%).\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2018_Slovenian_railway_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
