SUMMARY:Mia Mottley takes power (Barbados)
DESCRIPTION:Mia Amor Mottley is a Barbadian politician and lawyer who has s
 erved as the eighth prime minister of Barbados since 2018 and as Leader of
  the Barbados Labour Party (BLP) since 2008. Mottley is the first woman to
  hold both positions. Having overseen the abolition of the Barbadian monar
 chy\, she is the first prime minister of the Barbadian republic.\n\nNew le
 ader: Barbados\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mia_Mottley\nText: W
 ikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
