 mmit in 2018. On 26 May\, North Korean state chairman Kim Jong Un and Sout
 h Korean president Moon Jae-in met again in the joint Security Area\, this
  time on the North Korean side in the Inter-Korean Peace House in the Unif
 ication Pavilion.\n\nSummit: North Korea\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
