SUMMARY:Assassination of Jamal Khashoggi (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:On 2 October 2018\, Jamal Khashoggi\, a Saudi dissident journal
 ist\, was killed by agents of the Saudi government at the Saudi consulate 
 in Istanbul\, Turkey. Khashoggi was ambushed and strangled by a 15-member 
 squad of Saudi operatives. His body was dismembered and disposed of in a m
 anner that was never publicly revealed.\n\nAssassination: Turkey\nSource: 
 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Jamal_Khashoggi\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
