SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2018 Strasbourg attack (France)
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 11 December 2018\, a terrorist attack occurre
 d in Strasbourg\, France\, when a man attacked civilians in the city's bus
 y Christkindelsmärik with a revolver and a knife\, killing five and wound
 ing 11 before fleeing in a taxi. Authorities called the shooting an act of
  terrorism.\n\nCrisis: France\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_
 Strasbourg_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.de
