SUMMARY:Natural disaster: 2018 Sunda Strait tsunami (Indonesia)
DESCRIPTION:The 2018 Sunda Strait tsunami occurred on 22 December 2018 at a
 round 21:38 local time after large parts of the southwestern side of Anak 
 Krakatoa collapsed onto its caldera. The landslide spawned a tsunami wave 
 that struck multiple coastal regions in Banten and Lampung\, including the
  tourist destination of Anyer.\n\nCrisis: Indonesia\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/2018_Sunda_Strait_tsunami\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)
 \, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
