DESCRIPTION:On 7 January 2019\, members of the Armed Forces of Gabon announ
 ced a coup d'état in Gabon. Military officers claimed that they had ouste
 d President Ali Bongo\, who was re-elected in 2016 after a controversial e
 lection and protests.\n\nCoup: Gabon\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
