DESCRIPTION:The second inauguration of Nicolás Maduro as President of Vene
 zuela took place on Thursday\, 10 January 2019. The inauguration involved 
 the swearing-in of Nicolás Maduro for his second term\, and\, especially 
 within the context of Maduro's election\, has been controversial and conte
 sted by various figures and organizations.\n\nInauguration: Venezuela\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_inauguration_of_Nicol%C3%A1s_Mad
