SUMMARY:Assassination of Paweł Adamowicz (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:Paweł Adamowicz\, the mayor of Gdańsk\, Poland\, was fatally 
 stabbed on 13 January 2019 while onstage during a local public event marki
 ng the 27th finale of the Great Orchestra of Christmas Charity\, a nationw
 ide Polish charity fundraiser\, which was taking place in the city's Targ 
 Węglowy square.\n\nAssassination: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.or
 g/wiki/Assassination_of_Pawe%C5%82_Adamowicz\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
