SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Nairobi DusitD2 complex attack (Kenya)
DESCRIPTION:On January 15\, 2019\, a coordinated attack perpetrated by non-
 state militants occurred at the DusitD2 complex in Westlands District\, Na
 irobi\, Kenya. The attack began at around 14:30 EAT (UTC+3)\, shortly afte
 r a suicide bomber blew himself up near the centre of the complex at a res
 taurant.\n\nCrisis: Kenya\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi_D
 usitD2_complex_attack\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
