DESCRIPTION:On 15 January 2019\, a motion of no confidence in the governmen
 t of Theresa May was tabled in the House of Commons. On 16 January\, the H
 ouse rejected the motion by a vote of 325 to 306.\n\nParliament vote: Inte
 rnational\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_vote_of_confidence_i
