SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Maidan Shar attack (Afghanistan)
DESCRIPTION:On 21 January 2019\, in central Afghanistan\, the Taliban attac
 ked a military compound in Maidan Shar\, killing officers of the Afghan Na
 tional Directorate of Security. The Taliban attacked while engaging in the
  process of negotiating a truce with the United States.\n\nCrisis: Afghani
 stan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maidan_Shar_attack\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
