SUMMARY:Krišjānis Kariņš takes power (Latvia)
DESCRIPTION:Arturs Krišjānis Kariņš is a Latvian and American politicia
 n who served as the prime minister of Latvia from 2019 until 2023. A lingu
 ist and businessman by profession\, he previously served as Latvia's minis
 ter of Economics and a Member of the European Parliament.\n\nNew leader: L
 atvia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kri%C5%A1j%C4%81nis_Kari%C5%8
 6%C5%A1\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
