DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in El Salvador on 3 February 2
 019\, with Salvadorans electing the president and vice president for a fiv
 e-year term from 2019 to 2024.\n\nElection: El Salvador\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Salvadoran_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedi
