DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190208
SUMMARY:Haitian crisis (2018–present)
DESCRIPTION:The existing political\, economic\, and social crisis began wit
 h protests across cities in Haiti on 7 July 2018 in response to rising fue
 l prices. These protests gradually evolved into demands for the resignatio
 n of President Jovenel Moïse.\n\nProtest: Haiti\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Haitian_crisis_(2018%E2%80%93present)\nText: Wikipedia (CC B
 Y-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
