DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190214
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190215
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2019 Pulwama attack (India)
DESCRIPTION:The 2019 Pulwama attack occurred on 14 February 2019\, when a c
 onvoy of vehicles carrying Indian security personnel on the Jammu–Srinag
 ar National Highway was attacked by a vehicle-borne suicide bomber at Leth
 apora in the Pulwama district of the erstwhile state of Jammu and Kashmir.
 \n\nCrisis: India\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Pulwama_atta
 ck\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Pulwama_attack
