SUMMARY:Hirak (Algeria)
DESCRIPTION:The 2019–2021 Algerian protests\, also called Revolution of S
 miles or Hirak\, began on 16 February 2019\, six days after Abdelaziz Bout
 eflika announced his candidacy for a fifth presidential term in a signed s
 tatement.\n\nProtest: Algeria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hirak
 _(Algeria)\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
