DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190222
SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Libya vs Forces of the House of Represen
 tatives
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records an internationalised civil conflict between Govern
 ment of Libya and Forces of the House of Representatives (backed by Govern
 ment of Sudan\, Government of United Arab Emirates) over control of the go
 vernment\, starting 2019-02-21. This episode was active in 2 years (2019
 –2020)\, 1 of them at war level (1\,000+ battle deaths a year)\, and end
 ed 2020-10-31.\n\nConflict: Libya\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/113
 46\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
