DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190225
SUMMARY:2019 Cuban constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Cuba on 24 February 201
 9. Voters were asked whether they approved of a new constitution passed by
  the National Assembly of People's Power in July 2018. The reforms were ap
 proved\, with 91% of valid votes cast in favour.\n\nReferendum: Cuba\nSour
 ce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Cuban_constitutional_referendum\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Cuban_constitutional_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
