DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190225
SUMMARY:2019 Okinawan referendum (Japan)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum was held in Okinawa Prefecture on 24 February 2019
 . The referendum asked whether voters approved or opposed the landfill wor
 k at Henoko Bay for the construction of a new United States Marine Corps b
 ase. This is the second prefecture-wide referendum in Okinawa\, the first 
 being the 1996 referendum on the reduction of US military presence.\n\nRef
 erendum: Japan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Okinawan_refere
 ndum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Okinawan_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
