SUMMARY:2019 Bougainvillean independence referendum (Papua New Guinea)
DESCRIPTION:A non-binding independence referendum was held in Bougainville\
 , an autonomous region of Papua New Guinea\, between 23 November and 7 Dec
 ember 2019. The referendum question presented a choice between greater aut
 onomy within Papua New Guinea and full independence\; voters voted overwhe
 lmingly (98.31%) for independence.\n\nReferendum: Papua New Guinea\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Bougainvillean_independence_referendu
 m\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
