SUMMARY:2019 Romanian presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Romania on 10 November 2019
 \, with a second round held on 24 November 2019. They were the eighth pres
 idential election held in post-1989 Romania. Incumbent president Klaus Ioh
 annis\, first elected in the 2014 election\, was eligible for re-election.
 \n\nElection: Romania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Romanian
 _presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pag
 es.dev).
