SUMMARY:Zoran Tegeltija takes power (Bosnia and Herzegovina)
DESCRIPTION:Zoran Tegeltija is a Bosnian Serb politician serving as directo
 r of the Indirect Taxation Authority of Bosnia and Herzegovina (ITA) since
  June 2023. He previously served as Minister of Finance and Treasury from 
 January to June 2023. He also served as Chairman of the Council of Ministe
 rs of Bosnia and Herzegovina from 2019 to 2023.\n\nNew leader: Bosnia and 
 Herzegovina\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zoran_Tegeltija\nText: 
 Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
