SUMMARY:2019 Dominican general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Dominica on 6 December 2019. The
  elections were constitutionally due by March 2020\, but had been widely e
 xpected to take place before the end of 2019. The result was a landslide v
 ictory for the ruling Dominica Labour Party\, which won 18 of the 21 elect
 ed seats\, gaining three seats.\n\nElection: Dominica\nSource: https://en.
 wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Dominican_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
 -SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Dominican_general_election
