SUMMARY:Inauguration of Alberto Fernández (Argentina)
DESCRIPTION:The inauguration of Alberto Fernández as the 58th president of
  Argentina took place on 10 December 2019. Fernández wished for the bulk 
 of the ceremony\, including the concession of the presidential symbols\, t
 o take place in the Congressional Palace\, rather than in the Casa Rosada\
 , as it was the case in 2015.\n\nInauguration: Argentina\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inauguration_of_Alberto_Fern%C3%A1ndez\nText: Wikipe
 dia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
