SUMMARY:Sanna Marin takes power (Finland)
DESCRIPTION:Sanna Mirella Marin is a Finnish politician who served as prime
  minister of Finland from 2019 to 2023 and as the leader of the Social Dem
 ocratic Party of Finland (SDP) from 2020 to 2023. She was a Member of Parl
 iament from 2015 to 2023.\n\nNew leader: Finland\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Sanna_Marin\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.
