DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20191229
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: December 2019 Mogadishu bombing (Somalia)
DESCRIPTION:On 28 December 2019\, a suicide truck bomber killed at least 85
  people at the Ex-Control Afgoye police checkpoint in Mogadishu\, Somalia.
  More than 140 others were wounded and\, as of 31 December\, 12 people rem
 ained missing. Al-Shabaab claimed responsibility for the attack on 30 Dece
 mber.\n\nCrisis: Somalia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_2
 019_Mogadishu_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_2019_Mogadishu_bombing
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
