SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Angola vs FLEC-FAC-TN (Cabinda)
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Angola and 
 FLEC-FAC-TN over control of Cabinda\, starting 2019-12-31. This episode wa
 s active in 2 years (2019–2020)\, below war level (25–999 battle death
 s a year)\, and ended 2020-12-31.\n\nConflict: Angola\nSource: https://ucd
 p.uu.se/conflict/387\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages
 .dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
URL:https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/387
